    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e127f7c52f5d711172ad5044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你每年都为我庆祝。\n只要听到你的话语，\n就觉得这一年又能继续努力了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390923a6b7532dfa7b72d2b516e08a758c9aca8bcff552ccc359bb500296d1b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa69bc13b8999d83fa511589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日想要什么？那、那就……\n今天一天，让我独占哥哥吧！\n……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "291c6de602b82bc9f293d5cd504a068355c77882aa0c95747799bc56cb90f4c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b335c5f9c04f2d06c0a6338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到好消息了吗？\n会是什么呢，好期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e9b9afd2b28be7a41945e4c5786dfafcdc6915bc2bb7200cec011b0d0feaac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4164be937d080566bace661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了呢。\n我也来帮忙搭把手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "199b8beff049e572944a9cd4993d64e9d28a3e66241ed40eceb90486612db318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fdba47f5930f5b2a93d7129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成！\n还是老样子，很可靠呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea1eae5501f9a739088b0ebb5233d9086eb9b2b4124a9ea7509290488ce1dd5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b85f62e42ab0c35d222072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家好像都在忙着为活动做准备\n……有什么我能帮忙的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a343a388746a85311ac4886c1a403f4be2351e983e61cd9c68463e7397b4f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f2ee474fcc5a3f545f56969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办的活动看起来好热闹……！\n等忙完工作，一起去逛逛怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dbfef4898c7a429feb7deba4e8811166751a2874c2308628d444dcbdae5bbc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54eaaca519f9e94ab78b8758",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会再输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80307691efe6aac30b1547e300e3b6826c1f5ff0fa73eaba57784c4e89f02b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b28065d18a60aed3750c96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级上升了哦！\n一直都很努力呢……\n我也很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b6e0bfc8062dbca0c660e9e07551f77da0518f318f961c03582be3c2747b90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c19d5a69ebd49fd38314151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想多穿穿成熟稳重的衣服呢……\n因为有着想并肩前行的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecff941d7e5eb69af103c115f889e3045cf2e5fc8f3f5a44c86ddd96157a2e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:189a5427a054b5a0413d22c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一看到有缎带的衣服，\n就忍不住要买呢。\n实在太可爱了……根本抵抗不住~",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b20402a5ef54ab2339dbae416bec996a577a4fcd2704958d487597da9a99c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7554d25759e2df2ab4ee58a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小特前辈出门时\n居然双双迷路了……\n呜~这路痴属性真想好好治治……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0344d0dc2309c7558fe3c5232cf4ab39bba97e204493b862521f0c8bd726d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b823d13531f76edbf13b769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还想对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad87f37de39915525d2b71689443d936605b840bc1a39c32850694c7a109dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba8b35fdc14b3f843999ce2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是多亏了大家哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "335a58245233a30f89d49256eadd2dacc68db96cfc4934cf4fe7a651b0606ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:130954aa04fb7543691a4f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会再输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80307691efe6aac30b1547e300e3b6826c1f5ff0fa73eaba57784c4e89f02b78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
