    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abbc1d063381795b1d0b5d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81bbfcadc7b096bbec7263c4a502fbc683ad38cf63c74a3d2877521f6a468700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d746bd043476f69f7fcfdd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d8458e0d0c283a28cdf0b2904ed93a7dfbc7b68b667ed9ee61b5a7aaf69e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30698faeefcef396f7a360a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个。我会等着你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e98f62461fb864e1676fce252953053dbb9c29089397e568a6b73abd62a8a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73453e369445e40ef626eb4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~……我都长大了，\n体力也应该能跟上才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6802c970a9590649ee5466c92505cfc19a8af77059d2d103a4a6d5ad22e0159f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f4c52cd4395ad5a0d6747a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没事的。\n稍微休息一下就会有精神了。\n谢谢你担心我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87f2e7e953781b13313271f7c87e8fb338cd5e29385a4af14dac75e9ce5115e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b0a692da5343860eca5468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道的，如果是现在的我，\n能够走得更远——\n能够看到更美的景色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b1eea6298f04fc9c3ff7044292f5309d8fda3f7a66c492278dff9433bbb550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1411d17a758931ea14b7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那天的约定给我带来了力量……\n无论多远都能继续努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bb1d262a95f070ff919a545022c47dfab741744639335f9086cd414ad24ca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f51919cc76a471e65c167e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家今天很有干劲呢。\n呵呵……感觉受到了鼓舞。\n我也得打起精神努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed4b225602e602ed9e58364a1d83a3db21337e97062f2ccebda5ca558d624ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbdde70794c4c31447099d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边的人们是来看我的吗？\n……那么，得好好拿出成绩\n才行了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36d79e47fa93e2e705749a42b4fa889728f66dbb587ed3abdca72e2398eb83ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e29fcb079db6b51a507d0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请多多指教训练员。\n……欸嘿嘿，不管说多少次\n都很令人感动啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f736d5ed60ce0f0e497c6a88c89019db1060dffe2a9e0f33c716dae4fbdc2f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8caaa807bed86b081efe1245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么我能帮忙的吗？\n哪怕是小事……\n哪怕能帮上一点点忙也好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acb7ccf5325e6722d560f3b05086257b719cf2fb5aa69d95b38730c7b176eb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727e4c1b7c07467d906707d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天头发总是是梳理不好……\n一旦状态不好就会像小时候一样\n变得乱蓬蓬呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5976dfbe5c756c119fe5656584ec4ed0fff5ce26e38e1598a195f0ba0d7050db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bc047ad34fddfd4f97c307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便眼前不见璀璨景色，\n即便“绝景”很遥远……\n也要一步一步向前迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9739dcbadfdde8d9464a601db73a9ddbd140daa88db9db70c0d1aa0110430ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3003cf51dbc94520c04a4657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "煎蛋糊锅了，沙拉酱也忘了放\n……我今天是运势不好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01512eb168ae2b1fe0bef0d2740fa0cd9a9e666dbd3e213490ca58d418d7151d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61063f63774ea1df71fed1db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行哦，小景。\n得好好打起精神来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "802ef7ed130f6d9325fd2a87a9610ecb4979dd936536fdb9180b42352bc9e9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3aeddfd9c95c87e92bf0587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "硬撑的话梦想会越来越远哦。\n差不多该休息一下了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ae509dbb658826a1b465417916a4c443da22dcca0f5263bf20d9ea1b3b90ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c2eb786418f53e69237317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再继续参赛也不会有好处的。\n还是重新考虑一下吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "367e6454adba95dc0e906ac8f6d9250beccce4e337f94cafc879f847d2b68962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87c8a45be884d7bfaf4887c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留在心中的美丽“绝景”……\n我会传达给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef331f06193e478d3cbde0b48d7346a94c68c8425c3dd4e4ba191623f3518d86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15ec881f2451f34638b0a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我是无敌的哦！\n……因为你的双眼正在闪闪发光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d330733a71757ca9eab5627f1a3cfba9f6d4029a774accbc9878d920153bbb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9106a659f1e3135c8f9c6939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着支持我的大家，\n还有你的心意——现在的我，\n无论多远都能继续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cedaeba000ee27e052ab5f84f520a23e9f3ac26f7696da734a22aa3725f2d572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0225017018ebf340ace35cf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会赢的。\n你就稳坐后方等着吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04df34cec023be32c804efe2608c54235b753335dfa4394170b85fc0dd17d40a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a1a0412100ce4fcd44e8c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以去看看观众席吗？\n我想在开跑前把特意来加油的各位\n刻进眼里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a5038f63629ca3bea98b99b604540597cda1a285e60127831c5017f7373786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5569607d57480853134e5980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张？……不，完全没有！\n今天会遇见怎样的光辉呢……\n我满脑子想的都是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "237fc0cd581632d696655964ebaa1b9c428b56880c9e00a886ad735053870abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91040480b47ac751b3918777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多要开始了呢！\n我们的训练成果，\n会好好展现出来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fec6c77117c2dd8dcd38319501f849ceb7f38b281d2ea0676c9b35e9e3d371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02be135595bb534b7198e6a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你在身边果然很安心。\n现在也好过去也好，\n都能无畏地奔跑呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de04a237ab2731bcf9b590f70dfb301bffed26763681431728511756f8ebc52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb2642f200429fcdb9f1d35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心跳也好，光辉的景色也好\n都是一如既往。\n……嗯，应该能跑出我的风格！",
      "source_fingerprint": "069a383e37778855ae54c5a9b927b3f41e06371c6187fc78078218075c157af7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fa03e2aeae07521a9bbb61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，缎带松了？\n……重新系一下吧。\n缎带系紧，心态也就能系紧呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69a9d26014798b7ec033bf734c1f37aa330f916cf8721a9a198bc065453a27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8ac2e284c3114facb89c35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想用特制沙拉恢复精神……\n结果还挺难呢。\n下次要不试试青汁吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3305c940e377cf68c24e17c192d5ad95e3995d11815b04804af56986b5cff2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2f3db557940df1355247e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不满，\n多少也能坚持……别担心啦。\n我身体很结实，这你也知道的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef2e8753401b37c440b12b3c21a4040287aa6e44b740bd79c9eea54448b0c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cabd8e4a7980e2cc52f9de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是艰苦逆境，只要不断奔跑\n总有一天会抵达。\n……无论何时我都不会停下来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de01a2c3aeb0df8cf7357f01d243c65279d9c030b148fe22024b9094ff5aa100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c7afbbf8b47fdaad4e3128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有好好露出笑容吧？\n……太好了。\n可不想让大家感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c40fb966565f5c954cafd12c5e060fb94dd62ef10aa90f113087efc5849b91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425889cd4c5f00472a7acbee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论低头还是转身向后，都无法看到\n小特前辈展示的“绝景”……\n得好好向前看才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d44a35be4eb79fde07a26337ddf4c07286d799296347f16253a88c00376127e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21686ff1e68b8ad53ff70888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20038"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
